    "detailed_description": "<h1>Gallery Theft</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574680/extras/bc5f7550dc9251ff43e6800c90730d17.avif?t=1754314122\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gallery Theft throws you into a tense, heart-pounding heist where every step could be your last. Sneak through a maze full of security, and outsmart vigilant guards. Will you remain unseen?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574680/extras/a07a3abc8f79b92a453f2e2bf0b03752.poster.avif?t=1754314122\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574680/extras/a07a3abc8f79b92a453f2e2bf0b03752.webm?t=1754314122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574680/extras/a07a3abc8f79b92a453f2e2bf0b03752.mp4?t=1754314122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Gallery Theft</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gallery Theft is a suspenseful stealth adventure that keeps you on edge with every move. The tension builds as you carefully navigate a high-security gallery, avoiding cameras and outsmarting guards. Every shadow is a potential hiding spot, every sound a risk\u2014one wrong step, and the chase begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574680/extras/b412518fac8858ad674b26f221e01083.poster.avif?t=1754314122\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574680/extras/b412518fac8858ad674b26f221e01083.webm?t=1754314122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574680/extras/b412518fac8858ad674b26f221e01083.mp4?t=1754314122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a mix of strategy and quick thinking, you\u2019ll use distractions and clever tactics to make your way to the prize. The thrill of near misses and the satisfaction of a flawless escape will keep you coming back for one more heist. Will you slip away unseen or be caught in the act?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gallery Theft throws you into a tense, heart-pounding heist where every step could be your last. Sneak through a maze full of security, and outsmart vigilant guards. Will you remain unseen?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574680/extras/a07a3abc8f79b92a453f2e2bf0b03752.poster.avif?t=1754314122\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574680/extras/a07a3abc8f79b92a453f2e2bf0b03752.webm?t=1754314122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574680/extras/a07a3abc8f79b92a453f2e2bf0b03752.mp4?t=1754314122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Gallery Theft</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gallery Theft is a suspenseful stealth adventure that keeps you on edge with every move. The tension builds as you carefully navigate a high-security gallery, avoiding cameras and outsmarting guards. Every shadow is a potential hiding spot, every sound a risk\u2014one wrong step, and the chase begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574680/extras/b412518fac8858ad674b26f221e01083.poster.avif?t=1754314122\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574680/extras/b412518fac8858ad674b26f221e01083.webm?t=1754314122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574680/extras/b412518fac8858ad674b26f221e01083.mp4?t=1754314122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p